                "would / do",
                "will / do",
                "did / do"
            ],
            "answer": "would / do",
            "hint": "Saw (past) suggests a Type 2 question.",
            "explain": "Question structure: (Wh) + would + subject + verb + if...?",
            "tags": [
                "question"
            ]
        },
        {
